{
  "file" : "npc/quests/okolnir.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "This castle has a hidden secret."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "That is the ^4d4dff'Okolnir'^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "About Okolnir."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Go to Okolnir."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Cancel."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Okolnir is a kind of virtual realm..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "I don't know how Okolnir exists, but I guess only Valkyrie knows."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "As you know this is a place to test the adventurers made by Valkyrie..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "...you know the qualifications to enter Okolnir."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Qualifications?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Yes, Valkyrie definitely prefers strong adventurers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Only the qualified can enter Okolnir and Valhalla."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "It only opens when everyone comes together to work it out."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "The key is in the castle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "If a castle's ^4d4dffeconomy is over 65 and defense also over 30^000000, this will be acceptable to access Okolnir."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "And, if you pass all of the tests given by Valkyrie in Okolnir!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "You will also receive a mysterious gift."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Would you like to try to enter here?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Great! Economy and Defense are OK."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "You can enter Okolnir now...."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Do you want to go there?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Sure let's go there."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "No."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Ok......"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Please follow me..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "You can try this anytime in the future..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "If you are ready to protect this castle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "You are not qualified yet."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Please develop your castle more..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "... OK..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Good luck."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Enter now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "No."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Hope you get everything you want..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Really?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Sorry to hear that."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Building Okolnir needs quite a long time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "....even though it's only virtual..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "It takes about 12 - 13 hours to create the virtual realm."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "You'll have to wait."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "... I've never seen you before."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "You are strangers here. You'd better get out of here right now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "I am... Wish maiden."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Mourning in this virtual realm, Okolnir."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "On behalf of the humanbeings who defeated God here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Are you ready to endure the trials to get the Goddess' glory?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Yes, I am"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Sorry, I'll try later"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "I will test whether or not you deserve the Goddess shine..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Isn't it simple?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Okolnir is a virtual place."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "There is no room for error there."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "^ff0000You only have one hour.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 210,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "If you have not finished in that time, Okolnir will be destroyed, and I will go to rest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "You will have to wait again..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 215,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Are you ready to go through?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 216,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "^4d4dffYou need to have 16 to 20 members present^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "I will open the gate of Okolnir if your members are ready."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "We are ready."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "We need more time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Now I will open the gate of Okolnir where I am."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "I will wait for you on the top of Okolnir..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 232,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "I hope that you can complete all of the trials before the virtual Okolnir is destroyed..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Good luck."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 246,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "You need to have 16 to 20 members present to open the gate of Okolnir."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Come back when you are ready."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 255,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Don't hesitate to try."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 256,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "You should catch the chance when it comes to you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 257,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Just gather your fellow members."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 263,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 264,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "... Are you afraid of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 265,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "the trials facing you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 266,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "...."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 269,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 270,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Do you think that you can defeat the Goddess shine easily?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "I feel disappointed by all of you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 272,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Just go away..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Do you wish to enter?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 280,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Only those prepared may enter here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 281,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "You must bring several items to enter Okolnir."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 283,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 285,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Dusk Glow"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 286,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Dawn Essence"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 287,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Cold Moonlight"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 288,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Hazy Starlight."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 290,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 291,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Please bring those four things, 10 Agate, 10 Rose Quartz, and 20 Elunium,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 292,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "a Heavenly Maiden's Robe, as well as 100 Soft feathers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 294,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Goddess Tear"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 295,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Valkyrie's Token"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 296,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Brynhild Armor Piece"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 297,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Hero Remains"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 298,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Valkyrie Armor"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 299,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Andvari's Ring."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 302,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "You must bring those six things, 10 Gold, and 20 Elunium."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 303,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Many Valhala's Flowers are also required as an offering."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 307,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Once all of those are prepared, the gate will open."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 309,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 310,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : ".... "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "...........The Goddess shines brightly down on you, you should be stronger to deserve it..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 314,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Remember..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 315,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "You need to collect many soft feathers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 316,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "I hope that your dreams come true."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 318,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "I will answer all your requests if you bring these to me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 326,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "I am... Wish maiden."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 327,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Mourning in this virtual realm, Okolnir."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 328,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "On behalf of the humanbeings who defeated God here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 330,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 331,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "Bring me the one who brought you to this place."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 332,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : ".. Deliver him to my will."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 338,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
      "text" : "[Wish Maiden]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 339,
      "npc" : "Wish Maiden",
